Now bring down the both adapter:

[admin@localhost ~]$ sudo nmcli connection down  ens160
Connection 'ens160' successfully deactivated (D-Bus active path: /org/freedesktop/NetworkManager/ActiveConnection/6)
[admin@localhost ~]$

[admin@localhost ~]$ sudo nmcli connection down myconmae_ens224

Now both the connections are down

At this point we can restore (bring up the connection) from console

[admin@localhost ~]$ sudo nmcli connection up  ens160
[admin@localhost ~]$ sudo nmcli connection up  myconmae_ens224

